1
00:00:01,001 --> 00:00:03,336
[theme music playing]

2
00:00:03,420 --> 00:00:06,464
[tense music playing]

3
00:00:20,353 --> 00:00:21,730
[screaming]

4
00:00:21,813 --> 00:00:23,773
[shattering sound]

5
00:00:27,569 --> 00:00:30,113
<i>Mr. Paterno's dead.</i>
<i>We need to be cautious.</i>

6
00:00:30,196 --> 00:00:31,698
<i>I'm not dealing with just anybody.</i>

7
00:00:31,781 --> 00:00:34,868
<i>But I got a lead. Mercedes Palacio.</i>

8
00:00:34,951 --> 00:00:36,536
[Damian] <i>These people are</i>
<i>on a different level.</i>

9
00:00:36,619 --> 00:00:37,829
<i>She can't win this.</i>

10
00:00:37,912 --> 00:00:39,789
<i>I know you're worried for my daughter,</i>

11
00:00:39,873 --> 00:00:41,624
<i>but you have to trust her.</i>

12
00:00:41,708 --> 00:00:43,710
[Damian] <i>Camia, you need to fear them</i>

13
00:00:43,793 --> 00:00:47,255
<i>because Lily's already</i>
<i>standing in her own grave.</i>

14
00:00:47,338 --> 00:00:49,424
-[Anna] <i>I saw Arnaldo.</i>
-[Jepoy] <i>Arnaldo?</i>

15
00:00:49,507 --> 00:00:51,259
[Anna] <i>He didn't do anything to me.</i>

16
00:00:51,342 --> 00:00:52,761
<i>Actually, it seems like he's changed.</i>

17
00:00:52,844 --> 00:00:55,722
[Jepoy] <i>A snake may shed</i>
<i>its skin but it's still a snake.</i>

18
00:00:55,805 --> 00:00:57,891
-<i>You bastard!</i>
-[grunts]

19
00:00:58,266 --> 00:00:59,893
<i>-Why'd you hurt Anna?</i>
<i>-I don't--</i>

20
00:00:59,976 --> 00:01:01,686
<i>-What did I ever do to you?</i>
<i>-I don't know you!</i>

21
00:01:01,770 --> 00:01:03,855
<i>Why do you keep hurting the people I love?</i>

22
00:01:03,938 --> 00:01:06,441
<i>I was about to get rid of Arnaldo</i>

23
00:01:06,524 --> 00:01:07,859
<i>when he got in the way.</i>

24
00:01:07,942 --> 00:01:09,861
[Lily] <i>We are not murderers.</i>

25
00:01:09,944 --> 00:01:12,072
<i>If you kill even just</i>
<i>one of the Ardientes,</i>

26
00:01:12,155 --> 00:01:13,698
<i>we will forever have their blood</i>

27
00:01:13,782 --> 00:01:16,076
<i>smeared on our hands and conscience.</i>

28
00:01:16,159 --> 00:01:17,368
[Arnaldo] <i>I won't come with you.</i>

29
00:01:17,452 --> 00:01:18,912
<i>I won't be safer with any of you.</i>

30
00:01:18,995 --> 00:01:20,163
<i>What do you mean?</i>

31
00:01:20,246 --> 00:01:21,956
<i>I found out about your crimes, Grandpa.</i>

32
00:01:22,040 --> 00:01:23,750
-<i>Are you even my grandson?!</i>
-[Raul] <i>Papa!</i>

33
00:01:23,833 --> 00:01:26,461
<i>And, if you don't stop</i>
<i>harassing the Ardientes,</i>

34
00:01:26,544 --> 00:01:29,297
<i>I assure you, your loved ones</i>
<i>will be in grave danger.</i>

35
00:01:29,380 --> 00:01:30,840
<i>I've been to hell and back.</i>

36
00:01:30,924 --> 00:01:34,552
<i>So there's no way</i>
<i>I'll ever be afraid of you.</i>

37
00:01:34,636 --> 00:01:36,054
<i>What is this?</i>

38
00:01:36,137 --> 00:01:39,140
<i>I believe that at least</i>
<i>one of you Ardientes</i>

39
00:01:39,224 --> 00:01:41,851
<i>had something to do with</i>
<i>the bombings of my businesses.</i>

40
00:01:41,935 --> 00:01:42,977
[Mercedes] <i>Emilia, the time has come.</i>

41
00:01:43,061 --> 00:01:45,271
<i>Your real mother wants to see you.</i>

42
00:01:45,355 --> 00:01:46,397
[Emilia] <i>Mama?</i>

43
00:01:46,648 --> 00:01:49,025
[Helena] <i>Emilia, my daughter.</i>

44
00:01:53,363 --> 00:01:57,367
[sobbing]

45
00:02:02,831 --> 00:02:06,793
[sobbing]

46
00:02:12,674 --> 00:02:15,677
[Emilia continues sobbing]

47
00:02:16,845 --> 00:02:18,138
Mama…

48
00:02:22,684 --> 00:02:25,395
I've waited all these years.

49
00:02:27,897 --> 00:02:30,316
Not longer than I've waited, Emilia.

50
00:02:32,902 --> 00:02:37,157
But I… I just want to ask you.

51
00:02:40,285 --> 00:02:43,079
Why did you abandon me?

52
00:02:43,997 --> 00:02:46,332
Why, Mama? I want to understand.

53
00:02:46,416 --> 00:02:48,543
Why did you leave me? [sobs]

54
00:02:50,086 --> 00:02:52,338
I did not abandon you, Emilia.

55
00:02:54,382 --> 00:02:56,968
Then why is it that all these years,

56
00:02:57,343 --> 00:02:59,429
they made me believe
that the woman who raised me

57
00:02:59,512 --> 00:03:01,639
was my mother, not you?

58
00:03:01,723 --> 00:03:03,850
Why did you only show up now?

59
00:03:04,726 --> 00:03:08,813
Emilia, please don't blame me.
Don't doubt me.

60
00:03:08,897 --> 00:03:10,273
[sobs]

61
00:03:10,356 --> 00:03:12,775
I was a victim too, just like you.

62
00:03:13,651 --> 00:03:17,113
Somehow, I find it difficult
to believe that, Mama.

63
00:03:21,618 --> 00:03:24,829
Your father took you away from me, Emilia.

64
00:03:26,414 --> 00:03:28,333
Emilia, please believe me.

65
00:03:28,416 --> 00:03:31,711
All these years,
I thought that I lost you.

66
00:03:31,794 --> 00:03:33,546
[sobbing]

67
00:03:35,256 --> 00:03:39,636
You'll know the truth when your
father and I meet again soon.

68
00:03:40,011 --> 00:03:41,721
[whimpering]

69
00:03:41,804 --> 00:03:44,140
I want it to come straight from him…

70
00:03:45,183 --> 00:03:50,813
as to how and why he broke us apart.

71
00:03:52,357 --> 00:03:53,733
Emilia, darling…

72
00:03:54,609 --> 00:03:58,154
I want him to admit
the horrible thing he did to us.

73
00:04:02,742 --> 00:04:04,244
[sobs] Mama…

74
00:04:04,661 --> 00:04:06,746
Mama!

75
00:04:07,372 --> 00:04:09,916
[sobbing]

76
00:04:13,628 --> 00:04:16,172
[Emilia continues sobbing]

77
00:04:17,507 --> 00:04:19,717
My Mama… [sobs]

78
00:04:20,635 --> 00:04:22,136
Mama…

79
00:04:23,763 --> 00:04:26,891
[sobbing]

80
00:04:26,975 --> 00:04:30,478
[pensive music playing]

81
00:04:41,990 --> 00:04:44,993
[pensive music continues]

82
00:04:51,708 --> 00:04:55,420
Where did this come from?!
Who received this?!

83
00:04:56,129 --> 00:04:58,172
You didn't even check what was inside!

84
00:04:58,256 --> 00:05:01,050
What if it was a bomb? I could've died!

85
00:05:01,134 --> 00:05:02,635
We're sorry, boss.

86
00:05:02,719 --> 00:05:05,513
We didn't quite catch the woman
who left it at the gate.

87
00:05:05,596 --> 00:05:08,391
So, you didn't even know
who that woman was,

88
00:05:08,474 --> 00:05:10,727
and yet you accepted the gift?!

89
00:05:10,893 --> 00:05:15,023
You want some of this, huh?
You want this?! There!

90
00:05:17,942 --> 00:05:22,572
Well?! Don't just stand there!
Clean up those filthy maggots!

91
00:05:24,782 --> 00:05:28,286
[tense music playing]

92
00:05:31,873 --> 00:05:33,541
Chief De Dios, this is Miss Cruz.

93
00:05:34,876 --> 00:05:37,211
Miss Cruz. Have a seat, ma'am.

94
00:05:37,670 --> 00:05:39,839
Myla's jail transfer has been approved.

95
00:05:40,381 --> 00:05:42,216
We're just waiting for updates.

96
00:05:42,675 --> 00:05:43,634
Sir! Sir!

97
00:05:43,718 --> 00:05:45,428
-Why?
-We need to call the medic.

98
00:05:45,511 --> 00:05:48,598
-What happened?
-Myla Lomeda was stabbed.

99
00:05:48,681 --> 00:05:52,685
[tense music playing]

100
00:06:08,868 --> 00:06:13,456
[foreboding music playing]

101
00:06:27,178 --> 00:06:28,137
[Helena] Come here, darling.

102
00:06:32,850 --> 00:06:35,436
Mercedes, bring out all the jewelry.

103
00:06:38,815 --> 00:06:40,691
It's my surprise for you!

104
00:06:41,484 --> 00:06:45,571
Oh my gosh, Mama! Are these all for me?

105
00:06:45,655 --> 00:06:47,782
Yes, and you deserve more!

106
00:06:50,660 --> 00:06:51,619
Wow!

107
00:06:53,538 --> 00:06:56,040
But, Mama…

108
00:06:56,624 --> 00:06:59,544
None of these gifts
will solve my problems.

109
00:07:00,962 --> 00:07:02,630
Why, darling? What's wrong?

110
00:07:03,005 --> 00:07:05,091
Tell me about it and I will help you.

111
00:07:06,926 --> 00:07:09,387
I actually have three problems, Mama.

112
00:07:09,470 --> 00:07:11,848
Number one is Lily Cruz.

113
00:07:12,765 --> 00:07:15,810
She always wants to take me
and my family down.

114
00:07:15,893 --> 00:07:17,270
Number two is Papa.

115
00:07:17,353 --> 00:07:20,231
He never gives me the
opportunity to rise to power.

116
00:07:20,314 --> 00:07:23,734
He always wants everything
for himself. He's selfish.

117
00:07:24,527 --> 00:07:25,528
[sighs]

118
00:07:26,821 --> 00:07:28,781
And what is the third problem?

119
00:07:31,242 --> 00:07:32,743
It's, um…

120
00:07:32,827 --> 00:07:35,872
about my love life, Mama.
And it's too personal.

121
00:07:35,955 --> 00:07:38,791
[sighs] Don't worry, I'll help you.

122
00:07:39,083 --> 00:07:41,043
I'll go to Poblacion Ardiente.

123
00:07:41,919 --> 00:07:45,923
And I will eliminate both
your Papa and Lily Cruz.

124
00:07:46,591 --> 00:07:48,468
I'll give you back your crown

125
00:07:48,551 --> 00:07:50,595
and you will be the queen of Ardiente.

126
00:07:52,346 --> 00:07:54,098
Oh my god, Mama!

127
00:07:54,432 --> 00:07:56,184
You are the best!

128
00:07:56,726 --> 00:07:58,311
I love you so much, Mama.

129
00:07:58,394 --> 00:07:59,604
[Emilia chuckles]

130
00:08:06,652 --> 00:08:10,698
[somber music playing]

131
00:08:15,745 --> 00:08:16,829
Myla…

132
00:08:17,955 --> 00:08:21,459
Myla, don't worry. You're safe here.

133
00:08:22,043 --> 00:08:25,087
No one can just come in here.

134
00:08:25,505 --> 00:08:29,717
I might be safe but I'm sure
my family's in danger.

135
00:08:32,887 --> 00:08:35,723
You can tell me where your family is.

136
00:08:36,641 --> 00:08:38,017
I'll have them picked up.

137
00:08:38,726 --> 00:08:40,061
Thank you.

138
00:08:40,978 --> 00:08:43,731
I didn't think they could do this to me…

139
00:08:45,107 --> 00:08:47,818
after how loyal I was to them.

140
00:08:47,902 --> 00:08:50,571
That's why we should
help each other, Myla.

141
00:08:51,989 --> 00:08:55,493
Tell me where I can find Mercedes…

142
00:08:56,160 --> 00:08:57,954
so I can silence her.

143
00:08:59,914 --> 00:09:02,917
But, Mama, I just wanted to ask you…

144
00:09:03,000 --> 00:09:04,168
How'd you do that?

145
00:09:04,961 --> 00:09:07,171
Lily Cruz is no pushover,

146
00:09:07,255 --> 00:09:10,383
and Papa is a very powerful man.

147
00:09:11,384 --> 00:09:13,219
[exhales] Believe me, darling.

148
00:09:14,720 --> 00:09:17,974
They are amateurs compared to me.

149
00:09:18,599 --> 00:09:20,977
[sighs] I was just wondering, Mama.

150
00:09:21,769 --> 00:09:26,107
Who are you, really?
How did you clear my case?

151
00:09:26,190 --> 00:09:31,237
How did you talk Mateo into
getting me as his consultant?

152
00:09:31,320 --> 00:09:35,866
And about Aguas Realty, how did
you bomb all their properties?

153
00:09:36,200 --> 00:09:37,785
How'd you do that, Mama?

154
00:09:37,868 --> 00:09:40,830
How did you become this rich and powerful?

155
00:09:40,913 --> 00:09:44,959
[ominous music playing]

156
00:09:48,296 --> 00:09:50,381
[Myla] Even if you find Mercedes,

157
00:09:51,007 --> 00:09:53,175
none of this will end.

158
00:09:55,386 --> 00:09:58,055
Because Mercedes
isn't even the real boss here.

159
00:10:00,433 --> 00:10:04,186
Myla, if that's true, who's
the mastermind behind all this?

160
00:10:04,812 --> 00:10:09,317
You have to help me.
We need to help each other.

161
00:10:09,400 --> 00:10:12,153
Who is behind all of this, Myla?

162
00:10:14,822 --> 00:10:16,782
Red Dragon.

163
00:10:16,866 --> 00:10:20,953
[suspenseful music playing]

164
00:10:26,334 --> 00:10:27,710
Red Dragon.

165
00:10:28,002 --> 00:10:29,962
[suspenseful music swells]

166
00:10:38,721 --> 00:10:42,725
[foreboding music playing]

167
00:10:50,941 --> 00:10:51,942
Lily?

168
00:10:54,028 --> 00:10:54,987
[Lily sighs]

169
00:10:55,738 --> 00:10:58,658
Mercedes Palacio isn't my real enemy.

170
00:10:59,867 --> 00:11:01,410
It's Red Dragon.

171
00:11:01,744 --> 00:11:02,953
Red Dragon?

172
00:11:04,622 --> 00:11:10,961
No one knows Red Dragon's
identity or what she looks like.

173
00:11:11,587 --> 00:11:17,927
But from what I was told,
she controls all the syndicates.

174
00:11:18,260 --> 00:11:22,556
Be it drugs, robbery, terrorism…

175
00:11:22,640 --> 00:11:25,768
They all answer to Red Dragon.

176
00:11:27,103 --> 00:11:30,439
Compared to her,
Emilia and Julio are nothing.

177
00:11:31,107 --> 00:11:32,775
The question is…

178
00:11:33,234 --> 00:11:39,365
What's Red Dragon's connection
to Emilia and the Ardientes?

179
00:11:40,157 --> 00:11:43,994
[foreboding music playing]

180
00:11:54,713 --> 00:11:58,426
They call me Red Dragon,
"queen of the underworld."

181
00:11:58,509 --> 00:12:01,595
I hold politicians
and the law by the neck.

182
00:12:02,096 --> 00:12:04,014
But that is all you need to know for now.

183
00:12:04,515 --> 00:12:07,143
The important thing is, my dear daughter,

184
00:12:07,226 --> 00:12:09,478
we will never, ever be apart.

185
00:12:11,522 --> 00:12:14,483
[somber music playing]

186
00:12:17,236 --> 00:12:18,946
[Lily] Red Dragon

187
00:12:19,029 --> 00:12:23,117
is the head of the biggest
prostitution, smuggling,

188
00:12:23,200 --> 00:12:26,829
white slavery, kidnap-for-ransom,

189
00:12:26,912 --> 00:12:29,623
and terrorist syndicate
in the Philippines.

190
00:12:30,291 --> 00:12:34,587
But I just can't understand
why she'd come after me.

191
00:12:35,754 --> 00:12:39,592
Her second-in-command? Mercedes Palacio.

192
00:12:39,675 --> 00:12:42,636
She used to work with Mr. Paterno,

193
00:12:42,720 --> 00:12:47,808
and ordered Myla Lomeda
to bomb the condominiums,

194
00:12:47,892 --> 00:12:51,645
media complex,
and the Aguas Realty building.

195
00:12:51,729 --> 00:12:54,523
So it's Mercedes Palacio who carries out

196
00:12:54,607 --> 00:12:56,484
all of Red Dragon's orders?

197
00:12:56,567 --> 00:13:02,364
Yes. Mercedes Palacio is
our link to Red Dragon.

198
00:13:02,448 --> 00:13:07,536
That is, if we find her.
But I'm sure I will.

199
00:13:08,287 --> 00:13:11,207
[tense music playing]

200
00:13:23,010 --> 00:13:26,972
[somber music playing]

201
00:13:54,166 --> 00:13:56,168
[Julio] <i>Have you really come back?</i>

202
00:13:58,003 --> 00:13:59,171
<i>Why?</i>

203
00:14:00,923 --> 00:14:02,883
<i>Why now?</i>

204
00:14:05,594 --> 00:14:09,598
[somber music playing]

205
00:14:23,404 --> 00:14:28,409
[foreboding music playing]

206
00:14:43,382 --> 00:14:46,969
That business is under
Mercedes Palacio's name.

207
00:14:48,679 --> 00:14:50,347
Club Dragon Fly.

208
00:14:50,431 --> 00:14:54,977
If my hunch is right,
we'll find Red Dragon there.

209
00:14:55,853 --> 00:14:58,480
Whoever that Red Dragon is,

210
00:14:59,231 --> 00:15:02,526
I will make sure I find her.

211
00:15:05,029 --> 00:15:06,447
I hope she's ready.

212
00:15:10,075 --> 00:15:14,663
[tense music playing]

213
00:15:28,260 --> 00:15:32,389
[somber music playing]

214
00:15:37,144 --> 00:15:39,813
[clicks tongue, sighs]

215
00:15:39,897 --> 00:15:41,106
That Julio…

216
00:15:45,277 --> 00:15:47,363
Now that I've found you, Emilia…

217
00:15:47,696 --> 00:15:49,073
I promise you,

218
00:15:49,156 --> 00:15:53,369
no one and nothing is going
to separate us ever again.

219
00:15:55,496 --> 00:15:58,916
And if anyone tries, I will crush them.

220
00:15:59,959 --> 00:16:02,002
[scoffs] And that Papa of yours?

221
00:16:03,003 --> 00:16:05,297
He's going to get what he deserves.

222
00:16:07,508 --> 00:16:11,512
[foreboding music playing]

223
00:16:25,109 --> 00:16:28,070
[foreboding music playing]

224
00:16:41,417 --> 00:16:45,421
[foreboding music swells]

225
00:16:49,383 --> 00:16:51,593
[Anna] All right, please put those
in the car.

226
00:16:52,052 --> 00:16:53,053
Let's go.

227
00:16:54,596 --> 00:16:56,473
-Anna, we'll go ahead.
-All right.

228
00:16:56,557 --> 00:16:58,726
See you guys tomorrow. Take care.

229
00:16:59,059 --> 00:17:01,061
Ma'am, here's the assignment…

230
00:17:01,145 --> 00:17:02,813
Thank you very much for everything.

231
00:17:02,896 --> 00:17:05,607
We'll just come back tomorrow
for the kids.

232
00:17:05,899 --> 00:17:07,276
All right. Thank you.

233
00:17:15,284 --> 00:17:16,285
Let me help you with that.

234
00:17:23,250 --> 00:17:25,794
Looks like the kids really wore you out.

235
00:17:28,422 --> 00:17:30,382
I didn't get your name the other day.

236
00:17:30,466 --> 00:17:31,383
I'm Arnaldo, by the way.

237
00:17:32,760 --> 00:17:36,805
[soft music playing]

238
00:17:39,349 --> 00:17:40,601
-Jepoy!
-Wait, wait, wait!

239
00:17:40,684 --> 00:17:42,186
-Jepoy, wait!
-Stay away from her!

240
00:17:42,269 --> 00:17:43,937
Why are you always following her?!

241
00:17:45,814 --> 00:17:47,649
Just try going near her and I'll kill you!

242
00:17:47,733 --> 00:17:49,860
-Jepoy, stop it.
-Peace be with you.

243
00:17:50,986 --> 00:17:53,030
Just drop the act, will you?!

244
00:17:53,447 --> 00:17:55,491
No one's going to believe you,
you murderer!

245
00:17:55,741 --> 00:17:57,618
I might as well just kill you
while your brother's not here!

246
00:17:57,701 --> 00:17:58,744
[Anna] Jepoy!

247
00:17:58,827 --> 00:18:00,621
-Stop it, Jepoy.
-You're tough, right?

248
00:18:00,704 --> 00:18:02,915
-You're an Ardiente, right?
-Jepoy, would you stop that?

249
00:18:02,998 --> 00:18:05,501
Anna, don't protect that bastard!

250
00:18:05,584 --> 00:18:08,629
Anna, he'll kill you
if he gets the chance.

251
00:18:08,712 --> 00:18:11,298
But he wasn't fighting back!
He wasn't, right?

252
00:18:11,548 --> 00:18:13,634
Jepoy, we already talked about this.

253
00:18:13,717 --> 00:18:15,010
Anna, are you really that gullible?

254
00:18:15,094 --> 00:18:18,806
Don't let that liar fool you.
He's a murderer.

255
00:18:18,889 --> 00:18:20,099
He killed Aunt Carlotta.

256
00:18:20,182 --> 00:18:22,935
Go home and I'll finish him off
once and for all.

257
00:18:23,018 --> 00:18:27,356
Hold up, Jepoy. You're the one
who's keeping secrets here.

258
00:18:28,690 --> 00:18:29,858
You're the traitor.

259
00:18:29,942 --> 00:18:31,693
You're the one
who's not telling the truth.

260
00:18:31,777 --> 00:18:33,487
Anna, I don't know
what you're talking about.

261
00:18:33,570 --> 00:18:35,614
Jepoy, stop playing dumb.

262
00:18:35,697 --> 00:18:38,075
Why are you always outside day and night?

263
00:18:38,158 --> 00:18:42,579
Who are you going to?
Are you betraying us now, Jepoy?

264
00:18:43,872 --> 00:18:48,001
Why can't you answer me?
Spit it out! What are you up to?

265
00:18:49,336 --> 00:18:51,380
You don't know what you're talking about.

266
00:18:51,463 --> 00:18:53,882
Stay out of my business.
Do you understand?

267
00:18:55,134 --> 00:18:56,760
Stop it, Jepoy.

268
00:18:57,261 --> 00:18:59,638
Whatever you're doing, just stop it.

269
00:18:59,721 --> 00:19:01,431
That's only going to lead you to trouble.

270
00:19:02,724 --> 00:19:04,852
You don't know anything, Anna.

271
00:19:05,352 --> 00:19:07,354
You don't know what I'm going through.

272
00:19:12,943 --> 00:19:15,070
I guess you don't need me here anymore.

273
00:19:20,951 --> 00:19:21,952
Jepoy.

274
00:19:32,588 --> 00:19:33,547
Anna.

275
00:19:35,883 --> 00:19:36,884
Are you okay?

276
00:19:39,511 --> 00:19:40,470
[sighs]

277
00:19:43,098 --> 00:19:44,224
Thank you for trusting me.

278
00:19:47,144 --> 00:19:48,312
Sorry about that.

279
00:19:56,153 --> 00:19:58,697
[pensive music playing]

280
00:20:01,200 --> 00:20:03,076
-Madam.
-Mercedes, look.

281
00:20:03,827 --> 00:20:05,454
I finally met my daughter.

282
00:20:05,537 --> 00:20:08,207
Isn't she delightful? She's so pretty.

283
00:20:08,290 --> 00:20:10,250
She looks as beautiful as you, Madam.

284
00:20:10,334 --> 00:20:11,919
-Thank you.
-I hope, though,

285
00:20:12,002 --> 00:20:13,337
that you didn't provide her a copy

286
00:20:13,420 --> 00:20:16,048
as she might post it
on her social media accounts.

287
00:20:18,300 --> 00:20:21,511
Don't worry, Mercedes.
She does not have a copy.

288
00:20:24,848 --> 00:20:26,016
[soft thud]

289
00:20:27,726 --> 00:20:30,312
[stomping]

290
00:20:30,604 --> 00:20:32,272
There. Evidence gone.

291
00:20:33,774 --> 00:20:34,942
I just wanted to feel

292
00:20:35,025 --> 00:20:38,654
how a mother would normally feel
even for a few minutes.

293
00:20:39,112 --> 00:20:41,740
Rest assured, I won't be careless,

294
00:20:41,823 --> 00:20:44,409
especially now that
I've already met my daughter.

295
00:20:47,955 --> 00:20:50,999
I need to utilize all my power

296
00:20:51,083 --> 00:20:54,795
to be able to eliminate Emilia's enemies.

297
00:20:56,421 --> 00:20:58,674
Prepare for war, Mercedes.

298
00:20:59,132 --> 00:21:03,637
We will spare neither Julio nor Lily Cruz.

299
00:21:04,638 --> 00:21:08,100
[tense music playing]

300
00:21:15,565 --> 00:21:19,569
[action music playing]

301
00:21:41,008 --> 00:21:44,553
[tense music playing]

302
00:21:47,639 --> 00:21:50,017
We'll follow that car.

303
00:21:56,982 --> 00:21:59,860
Follow that car. Now.

304
00:22:09,911 --> 00:22:13,332
[tense music playing]

305
00:22:37,022 --> 00:22:41,026
[club music playing]

306
00:22:45,238 --> 00:22:47,949
[applauding]

307
00:22:50,160 --> 00:22:53,663
[club music playing]

308
00:22:56,374 --> 00:22:59,169
Hey, why are you still here? Hurry up!

309
00:22:59,252 --> 00:23:01,254
Hurry! Hurry! Hurry! Hurry! Hurry! Hurry!

310
00:23:01,338 --> 00:23:03,465
The show's about to start! Hurry! Go!

311
00:23:03,548 --> 00:23:06,301
Let's give them
a good show, girls! We're late!

312
00:23:06,384 --> 00:23:09,346
Boys, what are you doing? Hurry up!

313
00:23:09,429 --> 00:23:11,181
Come on! Come on! Do your best!

314
00:23:11,264 --> 00:23:13,767
Okay, let's go! Do your best!

315
00:23:14,309 --> 00:23:16,061
Excuse me! You two!

316
00:23:16,144 --> 00:23:20,398
Yeah, you two! Come here!
Were you sent by Jennifer?

317
00:23:22,692 --> 00:23:23,693
Uh…

318
00:23:23,777 --> 00:23:26,488
-Yeah, Jennifer.
-[Madonna] Come here.

319
00:23:26,571 --> 00:23:28,782
-That's us.
-Come on, hurry. Get changed.

320
00:23:28,865 --> 00:23:31,868
The show's about to start.
This one's yours.

321
00:23:31,952 --> 00:23:34,913
Hurry up! You need to look great.

322
00:23:34,996 --> 00:23:39,251
This is gonna be a great show.
Come on. Come on, hurry.

323
00:23:39,334 --> 00:23:41,419
This way, this way. Get dressed, hurry.

324
00:23:41,503 --> 00:23:43,547
[club music playing in distance]

325
00:23:44,548 --> 00:23:47,592
-We'll just get dressed.
-Okay, go. Go.

326
00:23:56,685 --> 00:24:00,730
[club music playing]

327
00:24:09,906 --> 00:24:13,160
[Madonna] Raffy, drinks, please.

328
00:24:14,786 --> 00:24:15,871
Thank you.

329
00:24:16,955 --> 00:24:21,835
[sensual music playing]

330
00:24:41,438 --> 00:24:46,484
[sensual music continues]

331
00:25:02,459 --> 00:25:07,464
[sensual music continues]

332
00:25:13,220 --> 00:25:14,679
Oh no.

333
00:25:14,971 --> 00:25:16,223
Good grief.

334
00:25:16,640 --> 00:25:18,266
Looks like they didn't even practice.

335
00:25:19,476 --> 00:25:20,518
[exasperated sigh]

336
00:25:20,852 --> 00:25:25,357
[sensual music continues]

337
00:25:44,793 --> 00:25:49,297
[sensual music continues]

338
00:26:02,852 --> 00:26:06,940
[sensual music continues]

339
00:26:17,409 --> 00:26:19,911
In fairness to them, they caught up.

340
00:26:19,995 --> 00:26:21,997
Very good.

341
00:26:23,248 --> 00:26:26,084
[crowd applauding]

342
00:26:30,922 --> 00:26:35,468
[sensual music continues]

343
00:26:44,311 --> 00:26:45,353
Madonna.

344
00:26:46,021 --> 00:26:47,314
Oh! [chuckles]

345
00:26:47,397 --> 00:26:49,983
Hello, Boss Apollo!

346
00:26:50,066 --> 00:26:52,193
You're looking very handsome today!

347
00:26:52,277 --> 00:26:55,238
You're so cute! [giggles]

348
00:26:55,322 --> 00:26:57,741
You're as cute as ever! So handsome!

349
00:26:57,824 --> 00:26:58,825
Who's that?

350
00:27:00,744 --> 00:27:01,828
Is she new?

351
00:27:01,911 --> 00:27:04,122
Uh, actually, sir,

352
00:27:04,205 --> 00:27:06,708
my best friend just asked me
to take them in.

353
00:27:07,125 --> 00:27:11,963
And you know how helpful
and charitable I am to everyone.

354
00:27:12,047 --> 00:27:15,967
So, um… I included them here.
But look at them!

355
00:27:16,051 --> 00:27:19,387
They're terrifically perfect.
Aren't they amazing?

356
00:27:20,013 --> 00:27:22,265
I only asked you one question.
You said too much.

357
00:27:22,349 --> 00:27:23,308
Uh…

358
00:27:23,391 --> 00:27:26,269
Why are you letting strangers
into my club?

359
00:27:27,270 --> 00:27:30,023
Your club? But you're just
the manager here.

360
00:27:30,106 --> 00:27:33,151
This is Red Dragon's club.

361
00:27:33,651 --> 00:27:36,863
-What did you say?
-Oh, sorry. I was just kidding!

362
00:27:36,946 --> 00:27:40,492
[laughing] That's not what I mean, sir.

363
00:27:40,575 --> 00:27:43,036
Bring her to the VIP room later.

364
00:27:43,953 --> 00:27:45,246
I want to meet her.

365
00:27:45,330 --> 00:27:47,332
Sure, sir. I will.

366
00:27:47,415 --> 00:27:49,376
[chuckling]

367
00:27:50,043 --> 00:27:53,588
Love you, sir. [chuckles sarcastically]

368
00:27:53,797 --> 00:27:58,301
[sensual music continues]

369
00:28:33,586 --> 00:28:38,091
[sensual music continues]

370
00:29:09,456 --> 00:29:14,461
[sensual music continues]

371
00:29:31,561 --> 00:29:36,566
[sensual music continues]

372
00:29:38,943 --> 00:29:41,446
[ominous music playing]

373
00:30:11,059 --> 00:30:15,647
[sensual music continues]

374
00:30:34,040 --> 00:30:37,544
[crowd applauding]

375
00:30:47,345 --> 00:30:51,391
[somber music playing]

376
00:30:56,354 --> 00:30:58,273
<i>I'm asking you. Who are you meeting?</i>

377
00:30:58,356 --> 00:30:59,732
<i>The governor.</i>

378
00:30:59,816 --> 00:31:02,402
<i>So with Papa having been</i>
<i>unseated as the governor,</i>

379
00:31:02,485 --> 00:31:05,572
<i>I'll just prove my worth</i>
<i>that I can still be the queen.</i>

380
00:31:05,655 --> 00:31:10,118
<i>Now that you're working</i>
<i>for this Mateo Ruiz…</i>

381
00:31:10,201 --> 00:31:12,745
[scoffs] <i>What is it</i>
<i>that you want me to do, Papa?</i>

382
00:31:13,454 --> 00:31:15,999
<i>Men are like dogs.</i>

383
00:31:16,082 --> 00:31:17,333
[mimics barking]

384
00:31:17,417 --> 00:31:22,797
<i>A little caress here and there,</i>
<i>and they're all yours.</i>

385
00:31:22,881 --> 00:31:27,343
<i>You're a very attractive woman.</i>
<i>I'm sure he'll give in to you.</i>

386
00:31:28,011 --> 00:31:29,637
<i>Did something happen between you?</i>

387
00:31:29,721 --> 00:31:31,139
<i>Raul, I can't believe you!</i>

388
00:31:31,222 --> 00:31:34,058
<i>If he has a hidden agenda,</i>
<i>that's not my problem anymore!</i>

389
00:31:34,142 --> 00:31:35,143
[Raul] <i>Yes, it is!</i>

390
00:31:35,226 --> 00:31:36,853
<i>That should be your concern</i>
<i>because we're married!</i>

391
00:31:36,936 --> 00:31:40,231
<i>Just because I let that thing</i>
<i>between you and Jaguar slide…</i>

392
00:31:40,315 --> 00:31:41,399
<i>What?</i>

393
00:31:41,482 --> 00:31:42,942
<i>Now you've got another guy lined up?</i>

394
00:31:43,026 --> 00:31:45,194
<i>You checked my phone, didn't you?</i>

395
00:31:45,278 --> 00:31:47,113
<i>I'm changing my password right now!</i>

396
00:31:47,196 --> 00:31:49,324
<i>If you aren't guilty,</i>
<i>you wouldn't do that!</i>

397
00:31:49,407 --> 00:31:52,744
<i>What is it you admire</i>
<i>about that governor, anyway?</i>

398
00:31:52,827 --> 00:31:55,538
<i>He's just Lily Cruz's lapdog, isn't he?</i>

399
00:31:55,622 --> 00:31:57,165
<i>That's what you think.</i>

400
00:31:57,248 --> 00:32:01,794
<i>What you don't know is that</i>
<i>Governor Ruiz has a new master.</i>

401
00:32:01,878 --> 00:32:04,213
<i>And you're in front of her.</i>
<i>Bye, Kitty-kitty!</i>

402
00:32:04,297 --> 00:32:05,423
<i>Meow!</i>

403
00:32:05,506 --> 00:32:08,885
<i>Oops, I'm sorry. Jaguar, bye-bye!</i>

404
00:32:08,968 --> 00:32:11,471
[tense music playing]

405
00:32:13,681 --> 00:32:14,724
[exhales]

406
00:32:19,938 --> 00:32:21,940
[inaudible]

407
00:32:28,029 --> 00:32:29,030
Apollo.

408
00:32:29,614 --> 00:32:31,616
[ominous music plays]

409
00:32:36,955 --> 00:32:39,082
Madam, welcome to paradise.

410
00:32:39,165 --> 00:32:40,917
-Your paradise, not mine.
-[thwacks]

411
00:32:41,334 --> 00:32:44,837
[tense music playing]

412
00:32:45,171 --> 00:32:47,590
You're turning my club
into your personal playground.

413
00:32:48,216 --> 00:32:50,009
I'm doing my job properly, Madam.

414
00:32:52,679 --> 00:32:53,972
I love my job.

415
00:32:54,263 --> 00:32:55,682
You know me, Apollo.

416
00:32:56,891 --> 00:32:59,060
I do not tolerate incompetence.

417
00:32:59,978 --> 00:33:03,481
Fail me just once… and you're out.

418
00:33:03,731 --> 00:33:07,777
[tense music playing]

419
00:33:10,363 --> 00:33:16,160
[Emilia humming]

420
00:33:17,787 --> 00:33:19,747
[chuckles] You look happy tonight.

421
00:33:21,749 --> 00:33:23,668
Why? Did I violate something?

422
00:33:23,751 --> 00:33:25,461
Is there a law against humming?

423
00:33:26,462 --> 00:33:30,425
No, but when it comes to your
obligations to me as my wife,

424
00:33:30,675 --> 00:33:32,552
that's where we have a problem.

425
00:33:33,469 --> 00:33:35,763
And how did this conversation
lead to that?

426
00:33:36,556 --> 00:33:39,308
Because after 20 years of our marriage,

427
00:33:40,059 --> 00:33:41,936
this is the first time
I've seen you this happy.

428
00:33:42,311 --> 00:33:44,063
Why? Is it wrong to be this happy?

429
00:33:45,231 --> 00:33:46,482
You're blooming tonight.

430
00:33:47,483 --> 00:33:48,985
Did someone hit a home run?

431
00:33:49,902 --> 00:33:51,946
What did you say?! You're disgusting.

432
00:33:52,989 --> 00:33:54,115
-Disgusting, huh?
-[gasps]

433
00:33:54,198 --> 00:33:55,616
[Emilia shrieking]

434
00:33:55,700 --> 00:33:57,452
-Raul, stop it!
-Hold on.

435
00:33:57,535 --> 00:33:59,620
Hey! You have your obligations
to me as my wife!

436
00:33:59,704 --> 00:34:01,414
Stop it! This is wrong--

437
00:34:01,497 --> 00:34:04,542
I'm not in the mood!
What's wrong with you?!

438
00:34:06,919 --> 00:34:07,920
Emilia!

439
00:34:10,214 --> 00:34:13,134
[panting]

440
00:34:21,225 --> 00:34:24,771
[sensual music playing]

441
00:34:25,146 --> 00:34:26,230
[chuckles]

442
00:34:29,650 --> 00:34:30,943
[chuckles]

443
00:34:38,618 --> 00:34:39,952
This way, sir.

444
00:34:49,921 --> 00:34:55,009
[tense music playing]

445
00:34:55,968 --> 00:34:57,762
Looks like Red Dragon's here.

446
00:34:59,180 --> 00:35:02,225
Let's follow them. Keep your eyes peeled.

447
00:35:07,355 --> 00:35:11,859
[tense music playing]

448
00:35:21,619 --> 00:35:23,704
[inaudible]

449
00:35:31,087 --> 00:35:32,380
Who are you?

450
00:35:33,714 --> 00:35:34,590
[Lily] Uh…

451
00:35:35,258 --> 00:35:37,009
Um, we're new here.

452
00:35:37,802 --> 00:35:41,472
We just got off the stage.
We're performers.

453
00:35:42,348 --> 00:35:43,683
Um…

454
00:35:43,975 --> 00:35:47,103
I need to use the ladies' room.
Do you know where that is?

455
00:35:47,395 --> 00:35:49,981
There's no restroom here, miss.
It's downstairs.

456
00:35:51,566 --> 00:35:52,775
Um…

457
00:35:55,361 --> 00:35:57,155
Are you performers too?

458
00:35:57,321 --> 00:35:59,490
We're waiting for customers.

459
00:35:59,574 --> 00:36:01,951
They'll call us when someone
wants to take us out--

460
00:36:02,034 --> 00:36:03,161
Shush! Don't tell her that!

461
00:36:03,244 --> 00:36:05,663
We'll get in trouble if anyone finds out.

462
00:36:05,746 --> 00:36:09,333
But she seems nice. We're friends, right?

463
00:36:15,006 --> 00:36:16,382
How old are you?

464
00:36:16,465 --> 00:36:19,427
-Seventeen.
-I'm sixteen.

465
00:36:20,636 --> 00:36:22,221
I'm seventeen.

466
00:36:23,014 --> 00:36:24,056
Oh.

467
00:36:28,477 --> 00:36:30,479
[whispers] Lily, we have to go.
Someone's coming.

468
00:36:31,105 --> 00:36:32,690
Let's go. Come on.

469
00:36:39,405 --> 00:36:43,367
[tense music playing]

470
00:36:57,423 --> 00:37:01,385
[phone ringing]

471
00:37:02,303 --> 00:37:03,971
[phone ringing]

472
00:37:06,557 --> 00:37:07,391
Hello?

473
00:37:09,393 --> 00:37:10,728
Hello, Madrigal?

474
00:37:11,187 --> 00:37:15,566
Well, I just wanted to say
that I need you now.

475
00:37:15,650 --> 00:37:17,818
So, come to me… now.

476
00:37:17,902 --> 00:37:21,364
Wow. You talk like you
own me or something.

477
00:37:21,447 --> 00:37:22,865
I'm not your lapdog.

478
00:37:22,949 --> 00:37:25,034
I'm paying you.

479
00:37:25,576 --> 00:37:28,996
<i>And you owe me your life, remember?</i>

480
00:37:29,956 --> 00:37:31,499
Have you forgotten?

481
00:37:32,166 --> 00:37:34,794
[sighs] Well, whether you like it or not,

482
00:37:35,336 --> 00:37:37,129
I'm your master,

483
00:37:37,213 --> 00:37:43,469
and you are my tempting and hot slave.

484
00:37:43,552 --> 00:37:45,388
And I need to see you now.

485
00:37:45,805 --> 00:37:48,307
Are you coming? For Mommy?

486
00:37:49,976 --> 00:37:51,477
[exhales sharply]

487
00:37:51,936 --> 00:37:55,940
[foreboding music playing]

488
00:38:11,205 --> 00:38:14,125
That Red Dragon is the devil incarnate.

489
00:38:14,208 --> 00:38:18,963
She's pimping underage girls?!
That woman is pure evil.

490
00:38:19,046 --> 00:38:20,214
We'll come back for them.

491
00:38:20,298 --> 00:38:23,551
But for now, we have to find out
who Red Dragon is.

492
00:38:27,179 --> 00:38:29,098
[Madonna] There you are, girl!

493
00:38:32,601 --> 00:38:35,896
Wait, did you go in there?

494
00:38:37,606 --> 00:38:39,650
Oh, dear. You're not allowed here.

495
00:38:41,944 --> 00:38:45,281
Anyway, honey, I've been looking for you.

496
00:38:45,865 --> 00:38:48,951
The boss wants to see you in the VIP room.

497
00:38:49,660 --> 00:38:50,828
Let's go.

498
00:38:50,911 --> 00:38:52,997
Red Dragon is waiting.

499
00:38:55,333 --> 00:38:57,460
Red Dragon will be there?

500
00:39:00,963 --> 00:39:03,424
Come on, girl. We have to go.

501
00:39:04,759 --> 00:39:07,011
You know, if you're lucky enough,

502
00:39:07,094 --> 00:39:10,097
you'll be one of the few
who get to see her.

503
00:39:10,681 --> 00:39:15,770
In all my years here,
I still haven't seen her myself.

504
00:39:17,813 --> 00:39:19,065
But why?

505
00:39:19,565 --> 00:39:23,277
Oh, honey, Red Dragon
is a very private person.

506
00:39:23,694 --> 00:39:26,405
Only a few people know her.

507
00:39:26,697 --> 00:39:30,576
And if things work out,
you might get to meet her.

508
00:39:30,659 --> 00:39:31,619
Let's go.

509
00:39:34,830 --> 00:39:39,960
[suspenseful music playing]

510
00:40:00,981 --> 00:40:02,817
This is all the club has earned?

511
00:40:03,067 --> 00:40:05,069
Well, there's nothing I can do

512
00:40:05,152 --> 00:40:07,863
if customers don't come in
like they used to.

513
00:40:08,697 --> 00:40:10,449
Ever since you were assigned here,

514
00:40:10,533 --> 00:40:14,370
this club's income has decreased
by three percent every month.

515
00:40:15,204 --> 00:40:17,039
You also have the lowest returns

516
00:40:17,123 --> 00:40:19,250
out of all the clubs that Red Dragon owns.

517
00:40:20,084 --> 00:40:23,295
And now you're saying
there's nothing you can do.

518
00:40:24,130 --> 00:40:25,798
Do a better job!

519
00:40:28,384 --> 00:40:30,428
But I am doing my job.

520
00:40:31,971 --> 00:40:33,889
[foreboding music playing]

521
00:40:42,398 --> 00:40:44,984
Is she the woman Boss Apollo requested?

522
00:40:45,401 --> 00:40:47,778
Yes, she is.

523
00:40:47,862 --> 00:40:50,531
Isn't she drop-dead gorgeous?

524
00:40:53,951 --> 00:40:55,119
Look, um…

525
00:40:55,578 --> 00:40:58,330
It seems like everyone's
a little tense here.

526
00:40:58,414 --> 00:41:01,792
Why don't we…
Why don't we have fun and relax?

527
00:41:01,959 --> 00:41:04,044
After all, that's the nature
of our business.

528
00:41:04,670 --> 00:41:06,755
I'll go get us some food and drinks.

529
00:41:09,508 --> 00:41:11,677
Come on in. They're waiting for you.

530
00:41:20,895 --> 00:41:21,812
[fingers snap]

531
00:41:21,896 --> 00:41:24,940
[unsettling music playing]

532
00:41:37,953 --> 00:41:39,705
[woman] Where's Madam Red Dragon?

533
00:41:45,044 --> 00:41:46,212
You just missed her.

534
00:41:46,295 --> 00:41:50,299
[tense music playing]

535
00:41:58,682 --> 00:41:59,767
Mercedes.

536
00:41:59,850 --> 00:42:01,936
-Madam?
-Keep an eye on Apollo.

537
00:42:02,561 --> 00:42:04,438
Make sure that he does what's necessary

538
00:42:04,522 --> 00:42:07,775
to improve the security detail
and income of this club.

539
00:42:07,858 --> 00:42:09,527
-Understood, Madam.
-Let's go.

540
00:42:09,610 --> 00:42:10,945
I'm bored of this place.

541
00:42:15,574 --> 00:42:17,493
Go on. Leave us.

542
00:42:19,578 --> 00:42:23,040
[tense music playing]

543
00:42:25,751 --> 00:42:26,752
Come here.

544
00:42:27,962 --> 00:42:30,923
[suspenseful music playing]

545
00:42:31,006 --> 00:42:32,132
Closer.

546
00:42:51,569 --> 00:42:52,778
What's your name?

547
00:42:56,865 --> 00:42:59,076
Call me whatever you want.

548
00:43:01,704 --> 00:43:05,708
[tense music playing]

549
00:43:11,338 --> 00:43:13,549
Looks like the girl is the boss' type.

550
00:43:14,174 --> 00:43:16,427
-Has Red Dragon left?
-She's gone.

551
00:43:16,510 --> 00:43:18,387
The boss has the girl to himself.

552
00:43:18,470 --> 00:43:20,264
[scoffs] Poor girl.

553
00:43:20,347 --> 00:43:22,141
[scoffs] Oh, well.

554
00:43:24,476 --> 00:43:28,564
[tense music playing]

555
00:43:35,487 --> 00:43:36,530
Nice.

556
00:43:39,867 --> 00:43:44,038
That's what I like about women like you.

557
00:43:46,624 --> 00:43:47,833
Good answer.

558
00:43:48,375 --> 00:43:50,377
[tense music playing]

559
00:43:51,754 --> 00:43:52,796
Feisty.

560
00:43:58,177 --> 00:44:02,598
[foreboding music playing]

561
00:44:07,811 --> 00:44:09,521
What are you doing here?

562
00:44:11,940 --> 00:44:13,692
You're not allowed here!

563
00:44:15,736 --> 00:44:19,698
[tense music playing]

564
00:44:29,833 --> 00:44:32,211
But I think it would be better if…

565
00:44:34,505 --> 00:44:36,423
if I were to see you without a mask.

566
00:44:36,507 --> 00:44:41,512
[tense music playing]

567
00:44:47,017 --> 00:44:47,893
[cop] <i>This is the police!</i>

568
00:44:47,976 --> 00:44:50,521
[Lily] <i>I know exactly what she's doing.</i>

569
00:44:50,604 --> 00:44:53,107
<i>That's why I'll never trust that woman.</i>

570
00:44:53,190 --> 00:44:56,068
[Helena] <i>That's what I want</i>
<i>to do to my new enemies.</i>

571
00:44:56,151 --> 00:45:01,073
<i>Just like fire melts gold,</i>
<i>I want to burn Lily Cruz alive!</i>

572
00:45:01,156 --> 00:45:03,909
[Damian] <i>You have no idea</i>
<i>how vicious your enemies are.</i>

573
00:45:03,992 --> 00:45:05,411
<i>But I'm here.</i>

574
00:45:05,494 --> 00:45:07,704
<i>I will protect you from Red Dragon,</i>

575
00:45:07,788 --> 00:45:09,289
<i>even if it kills me.</i>

576
00:45:09,373 --> 00:45:10,582
[Helena] <i>Pack your bags, Mercedes.</i>

577
00:45:10,666 --> 00:45:13,794
<i>It's time for me</i>
<i>to meet the devil himself.</i>

578
00:45:13,877 --> 00:45:15,254
<i>Hello, ex-lover.</i>

579
00:45:15,337 --> 00:45:17,131
<i>-Helena.</i>
<i>-I'm back.</i>

580
00:45:17,714 --> 00:45:19,800
<i>I am Red Dragon.</i>

581
00:45:19,883 --> 00:45:22,386
[theme music playing]
